{"id":"n66029-1-9","stage":1,"title":"라디오 · 电台广播","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66029-1-9-1","ko":"어제 라디오에 내가 좋아하는 가수가 나왔잖아.","zh":"昨天我喜欢的歌手上广播节目了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"라디오에","meaning":"电台广播","explanation":"라디오：电台广播；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"라디오","audio":"/audio/6314a358f4e72c51b9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66029","senseId":"1","lemma":"라디오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"라디오에","audio":"/audio/366801e999aeeeb2c8f0.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하는","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하는","audio":"/audio/2b4807c27825ce3100ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가수가","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수가","audio":"/audio/ca4b2b7f21d202c043ac.mp3"}},{"text":"나왔잖아.","meaning":"出来，播放出来","explanation":"나오다：出来，播放出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"22","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나왔잖아","audio":"/audio/19909c5c112d3e5a5114.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"6314a358f4e72c51","term":"라디오","zh":"电台广播","audio":"/audio/6314a358f4e72c51b9cc.mp3","entryId":"66029","definition":"广播局以电波形式把声音发出，让有收讯装置的人们收听；或指那种广播。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出来，播放出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"可以听到或看到广播电视节目。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/732cf436a5072a64c58c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66029-1-9-2","ko":"나도 들었어. 신청곡도 네가 보낸 거지?","zh":"我也听了，点歌也是你发过去的吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어.","meaning":"听、收听（广播）","explanation":"듣다：听、收听（广播）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}},{"text":"신청